{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"990300010010","name":"果穂","text":"みなさん、\r\n今日も営業お疲れ様でしたっ！","trans":"各位，\n今天的营业也辛苦大家了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010020","name":"果穂","text":"おうちに帰るまでがお仕事ですっ！\r\n今日もしっかり帰りましょうっ","trans":"回到家之前都算工作！\n今天也要好好地回去哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010030","name":"樹里","text":"カバンは前に持とうな！","trans":"包要抱在前面哦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010040","name":"智代子","text":"うん！","trans":"嗯！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010050","name":"凛世","text":"肩掛けカバンも……\r\n下ろしましょう……","trans":"挎包也……\n放下来吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010070","name":"智代子","text":"降りる人を優先して、\r\n順序よく乗るのも大切です！","trans":"优先让下车的人先走，\n按顺序上车也很重要！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010080","name":"凛世","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010090","name":"夏葉","text":"さぁ、帰宅も心を込めて\r\n全力よ！","trans":"来吧，回家也要用心\n全力以赴！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010100","name":"樹里","text":"んじゃ──","trans":"那么——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010110","name":"果穂","text":"放課後クライマックスガールズ\r\n退勤っ！","trans":"放课后Climax Girls\n下班！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990300010111","name":"一同","text":"退勤！","trans":"下班！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}